<h1><span class="icom_font">IC-</span>9700</h1>
<h2 class="catch_copy">High-Speed Real-Time Spectrum Scope, Waterfall Display, and Built-in 1200 MHz!<br />
This Supreme VHF/UHF Transceiver Provides a Brand New Experience!</h2>
</div>
