<div class="mod_cont">
<p><a href="/uploads/lineup/products/IC-9700USA/IC-9700_photo.pdf" target="_blank">Check out the step-by-step procedures on how to send and receive a picture from one IC-9700 to another.</a></p></div><!-- /.mod_cont -->
<h3 class="headline3 title">
Other Functions</h3>
<div class="mod_cont">
<ul class="disc">
	<li>Loud and clear audio</li>
